pe":"rich_text","block_id":"60EV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc0e1102-01f9-4ede-8b0f-990c66e5ea07","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"癖が少ないのが必要であればArchやGentooを使えばいいと思う","ts":"1625554102.168500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=qkZv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa135d82-cdd3-46da-811b-24c741074f4b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"仮に大統一Linuxがあったとしても今Linux使ってる方々はそれを望まないよねぇ","ts":"1625554081.167800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lHJ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"417be43f-1fc5-443a-ad52-47268fae107a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"というか多様性があるようでない、というか\nがんばってるとは思うんで、文句ではないんだけどね","ts":"1625554005.166700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0s45s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7468a9e-f6fc-48f3-8c50-f87b13b7fe8b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、みんなカーネルがLinuxでパッチ管理のよしあしを見ると、安全が増えてる部分とパッチがおせえ(あるいはパッチ都合で特定ディストリだけ問題がでるカーネル)とかもあるので、カーネルが多様性がないのがなあ...と思うことはあるw","ts":"1625553984.166300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NiP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91d22fb4-d560-4c68-97d9-56a9308e4176","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ですよねぇ","ts":"1625553877.164900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kfJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a089b5e9-713c-4843-afa6-fcb19416e893","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁ一概にそうとも言えないですけどね。セキュリティの問題とかあるので一つ死ぬと全員死ぬっていうのは良くない。","ts":"1625553747.164700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"433H3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bd8c372-6245-4e1e-b7ef-de41b0808d97","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://anond.hatelabo.jp/20210705122257\u003e","ts":"1625553355.164400","attachments":[{"fallback":"はてな匿名ダイアリー: Linuxの多様性なんてデメリットでしかない","id":1,"title":"Linuxの多様性なんてデメリットでしかない","title_link":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20210705122257","text":"言い換えるなら、多様性が各種設定を難しくし、普及を妨げているってこと。ディストリビューションの違いはもちろん、同じディストリであって…","thumb_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/images/og-image-1500.gif","blocks":null,"service_name":"はてな匿名ダイアリー","thumb_width":1500,"thumb_height":1000,"from_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20210705122257","original_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20210705122257"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"agXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb466cef-ef32-4635-8170-ccc3668d57dd","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"辞書が全く読み込まれてない気がする。。","ts":"1625553215.163500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CjC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d61223b-ad1e-47af-aa9e-fea9f629533a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"一応\u003c#C023EFATA0H|tech-ime\u003e がありますので宣伝しときます","ts":"1625553206.163300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XaX=O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2c00a99-02dc-4a89-836f-34d3578d6054","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"fcitx-skkの話なのですが、これ、設定ウィンドウはどこから開くんでしょう？","ts":"1625553196.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WkHf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e23ad262-d9c3-4676-9837-f23ecc0339e3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど、fcitx5-skkはまた今度試してみることにします。ありがとうございます!","ts":"1625553173.162600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nxk/E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3886fad-e4b6-4fb1-bdc1-e8b01336e6b4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"いつものインライン入力の問題な